      "message": "That would be a KMI break. Is there a way to guarantee that no partners are referenceing -\u003emap[]?\n\nHow about if `sbitmap_spinlock()` asserts proper alignment before returning the pointer to the spinlock? Then we couldn\u0027t inadvertantly break the assumption you are concerned about.",
